{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0090","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":7,"subject":"math","topic_key":"probability","total_weight":112,"expected_output":"screening-0090.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1923","source_sha256":"9107a9702781e93aa8b5366bfb625efa7fcd1bc945a3935c49a9e76fb25aabd3","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در یک کیسه $6$ مهرهٔ قرمز و $4$ مهرهٔ آبی موجود است. $1$ مهره را به تصادف از جعبه بیرون آورده و بدون نگاه‌کردن به آن مهرهٔ دوم را خارج می‌کنیم. با کدام احتمال مهرهٔ دوم قرمز است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سؤال ۱۹۲۳","aspect_ratio":0.0589}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{3}{5}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5064}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{2}{3}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5064}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{5}{9}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5064}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{11}{18}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5064}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"فرض کنیم احتمال آن‌که تیم A برنده شود برابر $a$ باشد، بنابراین احتمال آن‌که تیم A ببازد یا مساوی کند برابر $1-a$ خواهد بود. در صورتی‌که این تیم در ۳ بازی اول برنده شود و در بازی چهارم برنده نشود (که پیشامدهای آن‌ها مستقلند) خواهیم داشت:\n$a \\times a \\times a \\times (1 - a) = a^3(1 - a)$\nاما چون مشخص نیست کدام بازی‌ها را برنده می‌شود باید تعداد جایگشت‌های آن‌ها را نیز محاسبه کنیم. با استفاده از توزیع دوجمله‌ای داریم:\n$P = \\binom{4}{3} a^3 (1-a)^1 = 4a^3(1-a)$\nبرای این‌که این مقدار ماکزیمم شود از آن مشتق گرفته و برابر صفر قرار می‌دهیم:\n$P' = 12a^2(1-a) - 4a^3 = 0 \\Rightarrow 4a^2(3(1-a) - a) = 0 \\Rightarrow 3 - 3a - a = 0 \\Rightarrow 4a = 3 \\Rightarrow a = \\frac{3}{4}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"e16045af1da5b4aa843abe55e0e4cca7252fae5094d28e15fd3e2e1f173a2eb4","bytes":1402},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"5ac300f37180c41f22ce2f75b26aa14af986daa690996553926573e25a5f7388","bytes":1394},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"7db890eb21b0e764c653bf6fa525c7ec3b4e59fa713a051a4e9fd58bba5fd3c4","bytes":1488},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"0f49c019230ab2a7510f3408b9aecb17fc569aa53a9aef4046cf11f848c60979","bytes":1658},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1923/stem_1.webp","sha256":"2471101db8fffee5c61968aec80db6fdd0a6b3da0c32b8ac0c2fe564ebc18b31","bytes":31038}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1923,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":16,"solution_page":177,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1924","source_sha256":"bd633d9bbbfeac0677b9f2069395b076edcc8b194a65b77d055cf892f140c663","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"محمدطاها $10$ کلید در اختیار داشت که $2$ کلید، درب صندوق را باز می‌کرد. او دو کلید خود را گم کرده است، با کدام احتمال با امتحان اولین کلید از $8$ کلید باقی‌مانده درب صندوق باز می‌شود؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سؤال ۱۹۲۴","aspect_ratio":0.0576}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{1}{5}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5064}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5064}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{2}{9}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5064}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{5}{18}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5064}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌توانیم حالت‌های مختلف را به صورت زیر بنویسیم:\nحالت اول: روز اول باران ببارد و روز دوم باران نبارد: $0/6 \\times (1 - 0/8) = 0/6 \\times 0/2 = 0/12$\nحالت دوم: روز اول باران نبارد و روز دوم باران ببارد: $0/4 \\times 0/3 = 0/12$\nبنابراین احتمال مورد نظر برابر $0/12 + 0/12 = 0/24$ خواهد بود."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"3e5e669597ae321148201319af9aab054f2e58c7758265cac6c602eb35acb8a3","bytes":1392},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"457a3783000683a8ece8548bf281231fb172c9065b9757695593bd30d5d050f6","bytes":1250},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"9b3187ea9ff043a806912668957167415cc257045569e770d64bf2cd52229d48","bytes":1452},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"7119d8ce672ca79cc45c165e9b45a1901d8a1404b8cbf09a43a3df6c42caff15","bytes":1402},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1924/stem_1.webp","sha256":"232bb1784d9eeb222d1155a2c9ce48d217e381cf39cdb69a29f479a144f6c880","bytes":25676}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1924,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":16,"solution_page":177,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1925","source_sha256":"6ff62af93f2142b96eefdb6fa07785257ec072ee6255f8fa025bbdfb20574d4c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با احتمال $\\frac{1}{4}$ درب منزل «جواد» قفل است. کلید درب منزل در یک دسته کلید $5$تایی قرار دارد، با کدام احتمال قبل از امتحان‌کردن کلید سوم «جواد» می‌تواند وارد منزل شود؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سؤال ۱۹۲۵","aspect_ratio":0.0493}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"0/8"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.4359}],[{"type":"text","text":"0/82"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.4359}],[{"type":"text","text":"0/85"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.4359}],[{"type":"text","text":"0/88"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.4359}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"فرد مورد نظر یا در کنکور تجربی شرکت می‌کند یا ریاضی. بنابراین با استفاده از قانون احتمال کل می‌توان نوشت:\n$P(\\text{قبولی}) = P(\\text{ریاضی}) P(\\text{قبولی} | \\text{ریاضی}) + P(\\text{تجربی}) P(\\text{قبولی} | \\text{تجربی})$\n$= (\\frac{3}{5} \\times 0/4) + (\\frac{2}{5} \\times 0/6) = (0/6 \\times 0/4) + (0/4 \\times 0/6) = 0/24 + 0/24 = 0/48$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"ce9011314cc70f3b58bd2f13a1822303bbbb5b354d5a27cc9ef161779faf84bd","bytes":1304},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"a120b1b02cf9741c6ebc417670e3fa1ec66c3bcd852a0dabf084a95f7fbae812","bytes":1218},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"772e807b55a90e3a0b575302ddf6f1963d416adc80093e237be5e259e348454f","bytes":1556},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"fec45f1623ed67170b440f6b1b0dda0d1645b63ff97053696d2e8d0eb4434930","bytes":1208},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1925/stem_1.webp","sha256":"f9a8dd9e209549f3ee47fb0e2aea6865b66768c8ab7cc847eb8a87e8e1daf635","bytes":24492}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1925,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":16,"solution_page":178,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1926","source_sha256":"adb1c13fd2ec69606dc911ddb62eaa09e9fd7abad22482dfdbf146b7677c7ce6","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در ظرف $A$ تمام مهره‌ها سفید، در ظرف $B$ تمام مهره‌ها سیاه و در ظرف $C$، $\\frac{2}{3}$ مهره‌ها سفید و مابقی سیاه هستند. از یک ظرف به تصادف یک مهره خارج می‌کنیم، با کدام احتمال سفید است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سؤال ۱۹۲۶","aspect_ratio":0.0567}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{2}{3}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5513}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5513}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{4}{9}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5513}],[{"type":"text","text":"\\frac{5}{9}"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5513}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با استفاده از قانون احتمال کل داریم:\n$P(A) = P(M_1) P(A|M_1) + P(M_2) P(A|M_2) + P(M_3) P(A|M_3)$\n$= (0/25 \\times 0/01) + (0/35 \\times 0/04) + (0/4 \\times 0/02) = 0/0025 + 0/0140 + 0/0080 = 0/0245$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"7b4675698d64bd10efc5043ca0ec46a0f11a33bcc03b30bc411667b49fee2000","bytes":1198},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"16291177c71847b4f5790c73a80e1c2abfe631eea0f7e1d99ef9df580228d9b0","bytes":1060},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"7201a9ca33d22cb3152621134f992a3386e12fa7aa975ae48b131736a586bccc","bytes":1624},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"16c7b8c0f29c00e8f1f69a1749366fe60d93920a4cbe32054163b552d3f1cfb2","bytes":1260},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1926/stem_1.webp","sha256":"c9f081417433489a1c4a313a5ded15b353f324f75325003500accbce679a63c8","bytes":28258}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1926,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":16,"solution_page":178,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1927","source_sha256":"c5eb41d26071c9a280213c2fcf173d97e158eed2835def762d3811d54f3c1c41","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در یک روستا $60$ درصد ساکنین زن می‌باشند. احتمال آن‌که هر مرد واکسن کرونا زده باشد $0/8$ و برای هر زن این احتمال $0/9$ است. یک نفر از روستا خارج شده است، با کدام احتمال واکسن نزده است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سؤال ۱۹۲۷","aspect_ratio":0.0528}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"0/13"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.4936}],[{"type":"text","text":"0/14"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.4936}],[{"type":"text","text":"0/15"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.4936}],[{"type":"text","text":"0/16"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.4936}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم احتمال انتخاب هر جعبه برابر $\\frac{1}{2}$ است. بنابراین با استفاده از قانون احتمال کل احتمال خارج شدن مهرهٔ سفید برابر است با:\n$P(\\text{سفید}) = P(A) P(\\text{سفید} | A) + P(B) P(\\text{سفید} | B)$\n$= \\frac{1}{2} (\\frac{3}{5}) + \\frac{1}{2} (\\frac{4}{7}) = \\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{2}{7} = \\frac{21 + 20}{70} = \\frac{41}{70}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"20a491c00959a896b5bd034f88df327a35e6c536aa229373f4376d13d7dacc97","bytes":516},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"0abe5a8391ed6d1d918c7c9a80eb8d6855f4e7f04703db1fafe61f905e0ce0bb","bytes":82},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"0abe5a8391ed6d1d918c7c9a80eb8d6855f4e7f04703db1fafe61f905e0ce0bb","bytes":82},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"8cc868b68df0e468c387fae8dccf80f89033f1e45069ac676f9a39cab304a2bf","bytes":1554},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1927/stem_1.webp","sha256":"07f0de52c9310936a63c065d62dda1faaffed8628293bcb655da835932d0016a","bytes":15214}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1927,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":16,"solution_page":178,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1928","source_sha256":"4a7d6dd81d64e15c5190bd7e86cadcfe48d1fd2c38fde471ec3576441c3bcd17","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"جمعیت کلاس A سه برابر جمعیت کلاس B است. در کلاس A و کلاس B به ترتیب ۱۰ درصد و ۲۵ درصد دانش‌آموزان ورزشکار هستند. اگر از این جمع فردی انتخاب کنیم و ورزشکار باشد، به کدام احتمال عضو دانش‌آموزان کلاس B است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1928","aspect_ratio":0.0466}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۵}{۱۱}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.218}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۱۱}{۸۰}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.1923}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۱۳}{۸۰}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.1822}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۶}{۱۱}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.1869}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم احتمال انتقال هر یک از مهره‌های سفید و سیاه به ظرف دوم به ترتیب برابر $\\frac{3}{5}$ و $\\frac{2}{5}$ است. با توجه به این‌که مهره‌های ظرف دوم پس از انتقال به صورت ۵ سفید، ۴ سیاه و ۴ سفید، ۵ سیاه خواهد بود داریم:\n$P(\\text{سفید}) = P(\\text{انتقال سفید}) P(\\text{سفید از ظرف دوم}) + P(\\text{انتقال سیاه}) P(\\text{سفید از ظرف دوم})$\n$= (\\frac{3}{5} \\times \\frac{5}{9}) + (\\frac{2}{5} \\times \\frac{4}{9}) = \\frac{15}{45} + \\frac{8}{45} = \\frac{23}{45}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"11cb82ad7b32234d3a54824e7382b8c15adbbd8b1b57eff466edcf4115b66df5","bytes":116},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"acab1dba03896ce5fc71f93138ab676d1da4996a75d4c7f7687645d2bd383569","bytes":916},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"b137f3e876ddcbbb8a5600171e3af82b5adc2df0ae366faf665d571755e342bd","bytes":2880},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"a53b9988921b47ea560f65dc20ce90b12a7e2cbebc626a87318246b0b58d3161","bytes":2016},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1928/stem_1.webp","sha256":"a1e7c6f447f62671ceca5bde69791510f09e8d765e74256c2e09ec4f14a528cb","bytes":5768}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1928,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":17,"solution_page":178,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1929","source_sha256":"9800889af1e840eb098f0d59a66fcacb909e3f1bc632d6b72540f1298b8f40a5","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در یک شهرک ۲۵ درصد پسران و ۱۵ درصد دختران ورزشکار هستند. اگر ۱۹ درصد کل جوانان شهرک ورزشکار باشند، جمعیت پسران شهرک چند برابر جمعیت دختران شهرک است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1929","aspect_ratio":0.0461}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۲}{۳}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.2264}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۳}{۲}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.201}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۵}{۳}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.1876}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۳}{۵}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.1936}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"هر یک از ۲ مهرهٔ انتخابی می‌توانند سفید یا سیاه باشند که احتمالات آن‌ها به صورت زیر است:\nهر دو سفید: $\\frac{\\binom{4}{2}}{\\binom{7}{2}} = \\frac{6}{21}$\nهر دو سیاه: $\\frac{\\binom{3}{2}}{\\binom{7}{2}} = \\frac{3}{21}$\nیکی سفید و یکی سیاه: $\\frac{\\binom{4}{1} \\binom{3}{1}}{\\binom{7}{2}} = \\frac{12}{21}$\nمی‌دانیم در ظرف دوم ۵ مهرهٔ سفید و ۵ مهرهٔ سیاه وجود دارد. با انتقال مهره‌های بالا به این ظرف حالت‌های زیر رخ می‌دهد:\nاگر هر دو سفید باشند، ظرف شامل ۷ سفید و ۵ سیاه خواهد بود.\nاگر هر دو سیاه باشند، ظرف شامل ۵ سفید و ۷ سیاه خواهد بود.\nاگر یکی سفید و یکی سیاه باشد، ظرف شامل ۶ سفید و ۶ سیاه خواهد بود.\nدر نتیجه احتمال سفید بودن مهرهٔ خارج شده از ظرف دوم برابر است با:\n$P(W) = (\\frac{6}{21} \\times \\frac{7}{12}) + (\\frac{3}{21} \\times \\frac{5}{12}) + (\\frac{12}{21} \\times \\frac{6}{12}) = \\frac{42 + 15 + 72}{252} = \\frac{129}{252} = \\frac{43}{84}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"43b4187e16faa3f59671edc5e2e2e8f1266f6d37beff0ac2fb7c90fc7ca4d65b","bytes":110},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"6aec38eb18cf5db8842246f59f17cf76c97ddca8494e7517d8f31f7f44bbf07c","bytes":800},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"bf3576c64e7bcd1af3bdf499d336cfab0ef6aee4e8621526d5022ec842aacd1b","bytes":3208},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"3bac8b0006f1845a00bcacee72c5e4a48878b271bff701ea3cc915a5088bed97","bytes":1852},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1929/stem_1.webp","sha256":"a6111097261b80cc2d43ad6f3629c4f3c6b020e33705900db5edfbec8dc89e75","bytes":7450}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1929,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":17,"solution_page":178,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
